  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Raoult's law,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>.</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>.</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/>Here  <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mtext> torr</mtext><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn><mtext> torr, </mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></math>  and  <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>?</mo></math> <br/><br/>So 84 torr  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mtext> torr</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>0.8+</mtext><msubsup><mrow><mtext>p</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.2</mn></math> <br/><br/>or  <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>84</mn><mtext> torr</mtext><mo>-</mo><mn>56</mn><mtext> torr</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>140</mn><mtext> torr</mtext></math> .",
